# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.swprof: the home-screen swipe profile (docs/swipe-profile.md).
# passbench=1: tools/pass_bench (src/pass_bench.c): what one render pass costs by load/store setting; ends at once without the argument.
/redwood/bin/pass_bench ifarg passbench= &
# swprof=1: unlock, then 6 home-screen page swipes (about 5 s from log s 145; init cuts every rc line at 63 words, init.c:1125, so the 40 swipes this line once held never ran: 6 do; the earlier lc/swr logs ran the 6th at the default duration; bb_prof=115 bb_prof_all=1 samples the render thread for 10 s)
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg swprof=1 say start wait 120 tap 0.5 0.06 wait 1 notify com.redwood.unlock wait 5 say swprof swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45
